+# Commission staff questions and NORAD chat-log routing
+
+**November 9, 2026 · B129 / PD01 / PD07.** Two public archive copies preserve a January 2004 Commission email about operational records for a NEADS visit. A separate question sheet names one of the same chat-log identifiers. The Team 8 copy also preserves a dated reply giving a tentative transcript-based time for the first Flight 93 call. These records identify the sources staff wanted to test and show what they reported having available. [Archive member paths, hashes and line locators](SOURCE-PINS.json)
+
+## Production trail
+
+The January 18, 2004 **5:13 PM** message describes reviewing recent NEADS deliveries for **Document Req. 4**, revisiting older material and sending the first pages of four logs for the visit. It says the **53160** item appeared newly delivered and the other three had been on the Commission network since summer. The attached-file and delivery record needed to verify what was actually supplied remains unacquired. January 19 is also a print-footer date. Retain it separately from the sent fields. NYC Box 2 physical p. 2 lines 10–27 and 34, Team 8 Box 20 physical p. 3 lines 16–32 and 34. [Exact sources](SOURCE-PINS.json)
+
